        "sid": "1KI 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElija waseTishibi eGileyadi wathi kuAhabi: Ngifunga iNkosi, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, engiyinceku yayo, ukuthi kakuyikuba khona amazolo lezulu kuliminyaka ngaphandle kwelizwi lami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.5.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jak 5:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilizwi leNkosi uNkulunkulu lafika kuye lisithi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suka lapha, uqonde ngasempumalanga, ucatshe esifuleni iKerithi esingasempumalanga kweJordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzanatha amanzi kuso, ngilayile amawabayi ukukunika ukudla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenza njengokutsho kweNkosi, wahamba wayahlala esifuleni iKerithi esingasempumalanga kweJordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amawabayi amlethela izinkwa lenyama ekuseni lantambama, wanatha esifuleni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngemva kwesikhathi isifula satsha, ngoba kwakungelazulu elizweni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilizwi leNkosi laselifika kuye lisithi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suka uhambe, uye eZarefathi eliseSidoni, uhlale khona. Ngilayile umfelwakazi othile khona ukuba akunike ukudla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.4.25+LUK.4.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 4:25–26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesukake esiya eZarefathi. Kwathi lapho efika esangweni lomuzi wafumana khona umfelwakazi othile etheza inkuni; wathi kuye: Ake unginike amanzi ngenkezo ukuba nginathe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi esahamba ukuyawathatha, uElija wamemeza esithi: Ungiphathele isinkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wathi: Ngifunga iNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho kangiphekanga lutho, ngilemputshana nje esigxingini lamafutha ayingcosana egabheni; khathesi ngitheza lezinkunyana ukuba ngiyepheka ukuba mina lomntanami sidle singakafi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElija wathi kuye: Ungesabi; hamba uyekwenza njengokutsho kwakho, kodwa qala ungenzele iqebelengwana, ulilethe kimi, ubusuziphekela wena lomntanakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba iNkosi, uNkulunkulu wakoIsrayeli, ithi: Impuphu esesigxingini kayiyikuphela, lamafutha asegabheni kawayikuphela, kuze kufike usuku iNkosi ezanisa ngalo izulu emhlabeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasehambake, njengokutsho kukaElija. Badla insuku ezinengi, yena lomntanakhe loElija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Impuphu eyayisesigxingini kayiphelanga kanye lamafutha ayesegabheni, njengelizwi leNkosi eyalikhuluma ngoElija.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngemva kwesikhathi umntwana walowowesifazana, umninindlu, wagula; kwambamba kakhulu, kwaze kwasala udokoza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wasesithi kuElija: Ungibangisani, wena muntu kaNkulunkulu na? Uzile kimi ukuba izono zami zikhunjulwe lokungibulalela umntanami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wasesithi kuye: Nginika umntanakho. Wasemthatha ezandleni zikanina, waya laye endlini ephezulu lapho ayehlala khona, wamlalisa embhedeni wakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasekhuleka eNkosini esithi: Nkosi Nkulunkulu wami, uzamehlisela usizi lalo umfelwakazi engingenise kwakhe ngokumbulalela umntanakhe na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasephefumulela emntwaneni kathathu, wakhuleka wathi: Nkosi Nkulunkulu wami, akubuyise umphefumulo walumntwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yalizwa ilizwi likaElija, umphefumulo womntwana wabuya, umntwana waphaphama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElija wamthatha, wehla laye bevela endlini ephezulu, waya kwengaphansi, wamnika unina, wathi: Nangu umntanakho, usephila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owesifazana wathi kuElija: Khathesi ngiyazi ukuba ungumuntu kaNkulunkulu, lokuba ilizwi leNkosi olikhulumayo liliqiniso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
